      "message": "test(app): state the Bore entry in the hole-order test\n\nThe hole-order test (#3328, merge a796aa1c9) builds an OpParams::Bore\nwithout the `entry` field that the Bore entry feature (#3828, merge\nc04c762b8) added. Each PR was green alone; together the app test build\nfails (\"missing field `entry`\"), so the post-merge gate is red on main.\n\nThe test now states `Entry3D::Plunge`, the entry that the other Bore\ntests use. No production code changes.\n\nFixes #4155\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
